{"title":"Serving at Daily Bread Food Bank, Halloween morning 🎃","startsAt":"2026-10-31T10:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-31T12:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Hi everyone 🙏\n\nWe'll be serving together at Daily Bread Food Bank in Etobicoke on Halloween morning. They can take 8 of us, so register early to save your spot.\n\nMore than 1 in 10 people in Toronto now rely on food banks... visits are at an all-time high.\n\n**We'll start with a short tour, then help sort and pack donated food, or wherever they need us that morning. No experience needed, and it's** **free to join**.\n\n✦ **Saturday, October 31, 10am to 12pm** (please come 5 to 10 min early)\n✦ 191 New Toronto Street, Etobicoke (Lake Shore Blvd W & Islington)\n✦ Free parking, or the 110C bus from Islington Station\n✦ **Closed-toe shoes please**\n✦ Ages 18+\n\n**How to join**\n\n1. Create your Toronto Joy account. It's one time only and takes about 3 minutes.\n\n[https://torontojoy.org/register/](https://torontojoy.org/register/)\n\n2. Register on the event page by **Friday, October 16**:\n\nhttps://torontojoy.org/event/volunteer-at-daily-bread-food-bank/\n\nAlready have an account? Skip to step 2.\n\nOnly people registered on our website can take a spot.\n\nOnce you're registered, I'll send you Daily Bread's waiver to sign and our WhatsApp group link for day-of updates.\n\nIf you sign up, please do so with the intention of attending... Daily Bread is counting on us.\n\nWould be great to serve together! ❤️\nAmar and Team","venue":{"name":"191 New Toronto St","address":"191 New Toronto St, Etobicoke, ON M8V 2E7, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.606856,"lng":-79.504206,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Joy","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/3/1/9/highres_536389945.jpeg"}